{"unit_id": "tag:01I6:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n回顾一下，我们在《模（Modules）》的定义<REF_0001>中已经给出了拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）的抽象定义。本节证明，仿射概形（affine scheme）<MATH_0001>上的任意拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）都对应于层（sheaf）<MATH_0002>，后者与<MATH_0003>-模（module）<MATH_0004>相伴。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "被引用的章名"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "被回顾的抽象概念"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "本节讨论的层所在的空间"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "本节结论所适用的任意一层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "与给定拟凝聚层对应的层"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "给出对应层的模"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01I7:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是仿射概形（affine scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是一个<MATH_0003>-模（module）。存在一个典范同构（canonical isomorphism），其两端分别是层（sheaf）<MATH_0004>（与<MATH_0005>-模（module）<MATH_0006>相伴，见定义<REF_0001>）和层（sheaf）<MATH_0007>（与<MATH_0008>-模（module）<MATH_0009>相伴，见《模（Modules）》中的定义<REF_0002>）。这一同构（isomorphism）关于<MATH_0010>是函子性的（functorial）。特别地，层（sheaves）<MATH_0011>是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）。此外，这些层由以下映射性质（mapping property）刻画：<MATH_0012>，此式对任意<MATH_0013>-模（modules）的层（sheaf）<MATH_0014>均成立。这里，映射（map）<MATH_0015>对应于它在整体截面（global sections）上的作用。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "canonical isomorphism", "target_term": "典范同构"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性的"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "mapping property", "target_term": "映射性质"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "整体截面"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "引理所假定的空间类型"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "在引理开头给定的模"}, {"source_term": "canonical isomorphism", "target_term": "典范同构", "context": "两种构造所给层之间的同构"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "第一种构造给出的层"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "与第一层相伴的模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "第二种构造给出的层"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "与第二层相伴的模"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "被引用的章名"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "具有函子性的上述同构"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性的", "context": "同构随所给变量变化的性质"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "这里证明为拟凝聚的层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的", "context": "这些层的性质"}, {"source_term": "mapping property", "target_term": "映射性质", "context": "刻画这些层的性质"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "任取的层所取值的代数结构类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "映射性质所适用的任意一层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "通过整体截面上的作用给出的映射"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "整体截面", "context": "确定映射时考虑的截面"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01I7:proof", "translation": "由《模（Modules）》中的引理<REF_0001>，我们有态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>，它对应于映射（map）<MATH_0002>。设<MATH_0003>对应于素理想（prime）<MATH_0004>。在茎（stalks）上的诱导映射（induced map）就是映射（maps）<MATH_0005>，它们是同构（isomorphisms），因为<MATH_0006>。因此，映射（map）<MATH_0007>是同构（isomorphism）。所述映射性质（mapping property）由层（sheaves）<MATH_0008>的映射性质（mapping property）推出。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素理想"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "induced map", "target_term": "诱导映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "mapping property", "target_term": "映射性质"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "mapping property", "target_term": "映射性质"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "被引用的章名"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "由引理得到的态射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "所得到的态射对应的映射"}, {"source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素理想", "context": "与所取点对应的理想"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎", "context": "考察诱导映射的位置"}, {"source_term": "induced map", "target_term": "诱导映射", "context": "给定态射在茎上诱导的映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "茎上的具体映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "茎上映射的性质"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "由茎上的性质可知为同构的映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "对映射所得的结论"}, {"source_term": "mapping property", "target_term": "映射性质", "context": "本引理中要证明的映射性质"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "其映射性质已知的层"}, {"source_term": "mapping p